1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,994
Here is the argument in five steps.

2
00:00:02,994 --> 00:00:05,742
One: marriage is an institution.

3
00:00:05,742 --> 00:00:09,557
Two: it benefits men by setting limits on desire.

4
00:00:09,557 --> 00:00:13,736
Three: unlike cohabitation, it supplies a template.

5
00:00:13,736 --> 00:00:16,549
Four: it is a form of social capital.

6
00:00:16,549 --> 00:00:20,013
Five: normative marriage has six dimensions.

7
00:00:20,013 --> 00:00:23,736
Learn these five and you can answer any question on the essay.

